"(card terminal or cash in GEL) or by <strong>bank transfer</strong> where we"
" agree that method, as described on our <a href=\"%(u_payment)s\" "
"style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:600\">Payment</a> page. We may "
"refuse or cancel orders for stock, legal, or good-faith fraud-prevention "
"reasons; in that case you will not owe payment for undelivered goods or we "
"will refund amounts already received, as applicable."
msgstr ""
